ZERO IDEAS - IMPLEMENTATION SOURCE RECORD
25 November 2026

Readable source: Zero OS - 1000 ideas for the interface, sheet Catalog,
1000 unique consecutive idea numbers from 1 through 1000.
https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/11pQHMZPWcllxsOdZq2cZEypE6H2r9ewNQJUltl-6xqU/edit
Original tab name: Каталог. Original row references: A724:D724, A899:D899.

Idea 723: Format card. Detect an own file's type, version and declared
length from its header. Implementation: tools/inspect.zero, native Linux
and Windows command zero-inspect FILE. Five supported signatures:
ZTEXT001, ZPIX0001, ZPACK001, ZMEDIA01 and ZEROAPP1. No extension inference,
payload execution, extraction or claim of full content verification.

Idea 898: Capabilities of this browser build. List actual protocols and
rendering features, accompanied by original diagnostic pages.
Implementation: zero-web --capabilities, --help and built-in GUI --about;
browser/engine/capabilities-demo.zero and its Ztext document. The native
viewer currently has no network fetching protocol. The separate Zero OS
HTTP reader is explicitly distinguished from this native engine.

Scope: these are native Linux/Windows tool additions. They are not yet
integrated into guest Zero OS applications. Existing boot/kernel and
compiler behavior are unchanged. Detailed test evidence accompanies each
module; implementation and shipped test sources are original Zero.

